<Slide style={{ width: 1280, height: 720, background: '#F7F9FC', flexDirection: 'column' }}>
  {/* 页眉 A3 */}
  <Box style={{ width: '100%', height: 80, background: '#0E3F8C', flexDirection: 'row', alignItems: 'center', padding: '0 40px', gap: 16 }}>
    <Box style={{ width: 6, height: 36, background: '#FFC107' }} />
    <Text style={{ fontSize: 30, fontWeight: 'bold', color: '#FFFFFF' }}>系统边界与验收证据</Text>
    <Text style={{ fontSize: 17, color: '#C9D8F0', marginLeft: 18 }}>456 / 457 断言通过 · 诚实报告</Text>
  </Box>
  {/* 内容区 */}
  <Box style={{ height: 580, flexDirection: 'column', padding: '20px 40px', gap: 18 }}>
    {/* KPI 三联 */}
    <Box style={{ flexDirection: 'row', gap: 20, alignItems: 'center' }}>
      <Box style={{ flex: 1.4, background: '#0E3F8C', borderRadius: 12, padding: '16px 26px', flexDirection: 'row', alignItems: 'flex-end', gap: 12 }}>
        <Text style={{ fontSize: 76, fontWeight: 'bold', color: '#FFFFFF', lineHeight: 1 }}>456/457</Text>
        <Text style={{ fontSize: 18, color: '#8B9CC4', paddingBottom: 10 }}>断言通过 · 99.8%</Text>
      </Box>
      <Box style={{ flex: 1, background: '#FFFFFF', border: '1px solid #D6DCE5', borderRadius: 12, padding: '16px 24px', justifyContent: 'center' }}>
        <Text style={{ fontSize: 44, fontWeight: 'bold', color: '#1E4FA8' }}>15 个</Text>
        <Text style={{ fontSize: 16, color: '#4A5568' }}>确定性验收脚本 · 副本库运行 · 真实库零改动</Text>
      </Box>
      <Box style={{ flex: 1, background: '#FFFFFF', border: '1px solid #D6DCE5', borderRadius: 12, padding: '16px 24px', justifyContent: 'center' }}>
        <Text style={{ fontSize: 44, fontWeight: 'bold', color: '#1E4FA8' }}>1 条</Text>
        <Text style={{ fontSize: 16, color: '#4A5568' }}>已知失败断言 · README 如实标注 · 不改代码凑通过</Text>
      </Box>
    </Box>
    {/* 能做 / 不能做 */}
    <Box style={{ flex: 1, flexDirection: 'row', gap: 20 }}>
      <Box style={{ flex: 1.2, background: '#FFFFFF', border: '1px solid #D6DCE5', borderLeft: '6px solid #1E4FA8', borderRadius: 10, padding: '16px 22px', flexDirection: 'column', justifyContent: 'center' }}>
        <Text style={{ fontSize: 19, fontWeight: 'bold', color: '#1E4FA8', marginBottom: 8 }}>本系统能做到的</Text>
        <Text style={{ fontSize: 16, color: '#4A5568', lineHeight: 1.7 }}>
          ✓ 确定性规则判定，阈值可复现　　✓ 数据三层分离，事实不可篡改<br />
          ✓ AI 只解释不决策，调分走确认　✓ 三级预警同源，无第二套阈值<br />
          ✓ NULL 不当 0，缺测正确处理　　✓ 全部操作写审计日志可追溯<br />
          ✓ 本地 SQLite 一键启动可复现　　✓ 15 脚本 456/457 断言可重跑
        </Text>
      </Box>
      <Box style={{ flex: 1, background: '#FFFFFF', border: '1px solid #D6DCE5', borderLeft: '6px solid #D9534F', borderRadius: 10, padding: '16px 22px', flexDirection: 'column', justifyContent: 'center' }}>
        <Text style={{ fontSize: 19, fontWeight: 'bold', color: '#D9534F', marginBottom: 8 }}>本系统不能做到的（不夸大）</Text>
        <Text style={{ fontSize: 16, color: '#4A5568', lineHeight: 1.7 }}>
          ✗ 不做医学诊断或开处方　　　　✗ 不做连续监护或急救<br />
          ✗ 不替代医生面诊与专业判断　　✗ 阈值为演示规则非临床指南<br />
          ✗ 不保证 AI 建议绝对安全有效　✗ 不处理急症胸痛昏迷等<br />
          ✗ 不做用药调整，仅提醒记录　　✗ 无实时推送，跨端需刷新
        </Text>
      </Box>
    </Box>
  </Box>
  {/* 页脚 */}
  <Box style={{ height: 40, flexDirection: 'row', justifyContent: 'space-between', alignItems: 'center', padding: '0 40px' }}>
    <Text style={{ fontSize: 14, color: '#8B97A8' }}>迈康 MyCare · 老年慢病多智能体协同健康管理平台</Text>
    <Text style={{ fontSize: 14, color: '#1E4FA8' }}>14 / 15</Text>
  </Box>
</Slide>
